      "lane_id": "author",
      "objective": "Publish the cleared falsifiable implementation spec for RFC 0142 P4 (resolving Q3 + Q4, with the deploy plan / deploy_cursor / deploy receipt design and the serve-boot decoupling slices) only after the adjudicator ledger records a clearing verdict; this SPEC is the artifact the rfc-0142-p4-build run consumes. Apply the shadow-first convention for the new deploy path.",
